  "description": "Legends tell that elves are peaceful practitioners of magic. Not Edith, the killing elf. She’ll take any dirty job. Killing bandits, slaying slave traders, if it pays its weight in gold, she will bring bodies back. Outcast by her own kind, Edith and her magical talking mask, Berg, slice through the world but…why can’t she wield magic? And who exactly is hunting her…\nSource: Tapas",
